$grp PS_MissionDescription : "{3136BE42592F3B1B}PrefabsEditable/MissionDescription/EditableMissionDescription.et" {
 A_Situation_SEP {
  coords 4205.061 433.468 6289.29
  m_sTitle "I. Situation"
  m_sTextData "DTL: 15/10/2005, 1100hr, Chernarus."\
  ""\
  "For the past week our glorious Chernarussian Movement of the Red Star has been suffering under a massive combined US and CDF offensive. Our unit has been ordered to conduct a delaying action at the dilapidated town of Hamertin which sits atop a vital road junction, this is in order to buy time for friendly forces further west to regroup and reorganize. The majority of our infantry force has been concentrated in and around the town, although a number of smaller units have been deployed forward and to the flanks."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "GC_SEPARATIST"
  }
 }
 B_Mission_SEP {
  coords 4208.542 433.585 6293.969
  m_sTitle "II. Mission"
  m_sTextData "Sufficiently delay or outright prevent the capture of Hamertin for at least 50 minutes, if we are unable to hold the town then we should retreat to the west. Our most vital piece of equipment is our BMP-1P and its Konkurs ATGM, if we are forced to retreat the survival of it and its crew should be prioritized."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "GC_SEPARATIST"
  }
  m_iOrder 1
 }
 C_FriendlyForce_SEP {
  coords 4243.041 437.873 6327.248
  m_sTitle "III. Friendly Forces"
  m_sTextData "Our overall unit constist of roughly 3x platoons worth of irregular infantry, dispersed throughout the AO but primarily concentrated around Hamertin itself. The rough location of our various sub units have been marked. We have established multiple PKM and NSV fighting positions around Hamertin, these are already manned and have been marked. "\
  ""\
  "Assuming our crew hasn't been killed or otherwise lost we are equiped 1x BMP-1P (Konkurs ATGM). We have 2x UAZ452 vans."\
  ""\
  "We are equiped with Soviet and Russian small arms, and wear a wide variety of uniform patterns and camouflage. Wehave little if any PPE such as helmets and body armor."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "GC_SEPARATIST"
  }
  m_iOrder 2
 }
 D_EnemyForce_SEP {
  coords 4212.644 433.023 6316.542
  m_sTitle "IV. Enemy Forces"
  m_sTextData "The approaching US force consists of 1x mechanized infrantry platoon, it is equiped with 3x Stryker APC each amred with a CROWS M2, and 1x uparmored Humvee armed with M2."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "GC_SEPARATIST"
  }
  m_iOrder 3
 }
}